"Endpoints (https://efile.fara.gov/ords/fara/r/fara_ws/api/endpoints)\nciteturn60view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/ords/fara/r/fara_ws/api/endpoints\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 79\nL0: [Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input]\nL1: \nL2: cite0†FARA.gov L3: \nL4:   * APEX_PUBLIC_USER\nL5:   * cite1†Return to FARA.gov L6: \nL7: ## Endpoints\nL8: \nL9: # API Endpoints\nL10: \nL11: This page is intended for users who are already familiar with APIs. If you're not sure what endpoint means, and the difference between `XML`, `CSV` and `JSON`, you may find the cite2†introductory tutorial more useful to start.\nL12: \nL13: Endpoints do not currently require any authorization. Result data is encoded as iso-8859-1 (or ansi for Windows platform users).\nL14: ### Status Codes\nL15: \nL16: In general, status codes returned are as follows:\nL17: \nL18:   * 200 if the request is successful\nL19:   * 400 if the request is malformed\nL20:   * 500 for server-side errors\nL21: ### API Throttle Limits\nL22: \nL23: In order to provide a high quality of service to all users, there are throttle limits applied to the usage of the API. The API supports 5 requests every 10 seconds. All endpoints within an API share the same limits.\nL24: \nL25: You will receive the following error when the throttle limit is exceeded:\nL26: \nL27: > Error Code: 429\nL28: >\nL29: > Description: Request rate too high\nL30: The API limit is enforced within a rolling 10 second window. If you exceeded your limit then you will be blocked from making further API calls until the current 10 second window expires. Due to the fact that this rolling window is not tied to any standard time, the best way to ensure you will not trigger the limit is to place appropriate delays between each API call.\nL31: ## Endpoints and Methods\nL32: \nL33: The currently available endpoints are listed in the following table. All endpoint URLs are accessible via the prefix https://efile.fara.gov. Example endpoint URL: cite3†https://efile.fara.gov/api/v1/Registrants/html/Active L34: ## Endpoint Index\nL35: Endpoint  | Methods  | Description\nL36: --- | --- | ---\nL37: `HTML`cite3†/api/v1/Registrants/html/Active L38: `CSV`cite4†/api/v1/Registrants/csv/Active L39: `XML`cite5†/api/v1/Registrants/xml/Active L40: `JSON`cite6†/api/v1/Registrants/json/Active | GET  | Returns registration number and available data for all ACTIVE registrants.\nL41: `HTML`cite7†/api/v1/Registrants/html/Terminated L42: `CSV`cite8†/api/v1/Registrants/csv/Terminated L43: `XML`cite9†/api/v1/Registrants/xml/Terminated L44: `JSON`cite10†/api/v1/Registrants/json/Terminated | GET  | Returns registration number and available data for all TERMINATED registrants.\nL45: `HTML`/api/v1/Registrants/html/New?from=:fromDate&to=:toDate\nL46: `CSV`/api/v1/Registrants/csv/New?from=:fromDate&to=:toDate\nL47: `XML`/api/v1/Registrants/xml/New?from=:fromDate&to=:toDate\nL48: `JSON`/api/v1/Registrants/json/New?from=:fromDate&to=:toDate  | GET  | Returns registration number and available data for all registrants that have a \"Registration Date\" value between specified \"From\" and \"To\" dates (format MM-DD-YYYY, identified as parameters \"from\" and \"to\"). (`:fromDate` and `:toDate` parameters are required).\nL49: Example URL: /api/v1/Registrants/xml/New?from=01-01-2010&to=12-31-2010\nL50: `HTML`/api/v1/RegDocs/html/:registrationNumber\nL51: `CSV`/api/v1/RegDocs/csv/:registrationNumber\nL52: `XML`/api/v1/RegDocs/xml/:registrationNumber\nL53: `JSON`/api/v1/RegDocs/json/:registrationNumber  | GET  | Returns list of all available registration document URLs (PDF format) and data for provided registration number (`:registrationNumber` parameter is required).\nL54: Example URL: /api/v1/RegDocs/xml/1234\nL55: Note: RegDocs endpoint can also be filtered by 'Country' and/or 'Document Type' parameters. See cite11†RegDocs endpoint page for more details.\nL56: `HTML`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/html/Active/:registrationNumber\nL57: `CSV`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/csv/Active/:registrationNumber\nL58: `XML`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/xml/Active/:registrationNumber\nL59: `JSON`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/json/Active/:registrationNumber  | GET  | Returns all available ACTIVE short form registrant data for provided registration number (`:registrationNumber` parameter is required).\nL60: Example URL: /api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/xml/Active/1234\nL61: `HTML`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/html/Terminated/:registrationNumber\nL62: `CSV`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/csv/Terminated/:registrationNumber\nL63: `XML`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/xml/Terminated/:registrationNumber\nL64: `JSON`/api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/json/Terminated/:registrationNumber  | GET  | Returns all available TERMINATED short form registrant data for provided registration number (`:registrationNumber` parameter is required).\nL65: Example URL: /api/v1/ShortFormRegistrants/xml/Terminated/1234\nL66: `HTML`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/html/Active/:registrationNumber\nL67: `CSV`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/csv/Active/:registrationNumber\nL68: `XML`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/xml/Active/:registrationNumber\nL69: `JSON`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/json/Active/:registrationNumber  | GET  | Returns all available ACTIVE foreign principal data for provided registration number (`:registrationNumber` parameter is required).\nL70: Example URL: /api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/xml/Active/1234\nL71: `HTML`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/html/Terminated/:registrationNumber\nL72: `CSV`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/csv/Terminated/:registrationNumber\nL73: `XML`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/xml/Terminated/:registrationNumber\nL74: `JSON`/api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/json/Terminated/:registrationNumber  | GET  | Returns all available TERMINATED foreign principal data for provided registration number (`:registrationNumber` parameter is required).\nL75: Example URL: /api/v1/ForeignPrincipals/xml/Terminated/1234\nL76: release 1.0 cite12†Set Screen Reader Mode On L77: \nL78: [Input] [Input][Input]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn60view1 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/ords/fara/api/v1/Registrants/html/New?from=01-01-2025&to=12-31-2025\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://efile.fara.gov/ords/fara/api/v1/Registrants/html/New?from=01-01-2025&to=12-31-2025 is not accessible via this tool.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn60view2 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/ords/fara/api/v1/RegDocs/html/7518\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://efile.fara.gov/ords/fara/api/v1/RegDocs/html/7518 is not accessible via this tool.\n"
